From: Karin-Laboratory contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: mediatek: document the observed MT6990 platform

The B-unit boot_b FDT reports the MediaTek MT6990 SoC and the
mediatek,evb6990_cpe_mt7990_emmc platform compatible. Add those observed
strings to the MediaTek root-node binding. This does not claim that SBAT6D is
a MediaTek evaluation board; the board string is retained as the firmware's
reported compatibility identifier.

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/mediatek.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/mediatek.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/mediatek.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/mediatek.yaml
@@ -71,6 +71,10 @@ properties:
               - archermind,mt6797-x20-dev
               - mediatek,mt6797-evb
           - const: mediatek,mt6797
+      - items:
+          - const: mediatek,evb6990_cpe_mt7990_emmc
+          - const: mediatek,mt6990
+
       - items:
           - enum:
               - bananapi,bpi-r64
